            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï pïchay Yoswö lö, “Kikighacha lenyoni ompöwölo kikïlïmacha lö kimwochï ECHOTYON Tororötïngu Musa mötworintenyi kïkonokwa koronï kïmïkul akïpar akwompö akwa pich löwïr cho möngöy ori, kïlenyona kikyotyecha nyoman ompö akwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmitecha ye nyu moriku, idecha wölo keda lenyini kesïwenyi lö karam.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïsörunö Yoswö chane, mori pipö Israel tömöpar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kwigh Yoswö chane asisoni kïlïkwï pich cho pösöy kwen akïrömchï pögh pipö Israel nko ato kïpelo amörostino ECHOTYON kïnomnyö lenyoni nko nyete le ye ompö wölini kikïl ECHOTYON kesagha nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
